      "evidence_rule": "prompt carries the question and the exact values of qa.gold_inds (section-ordered); no programs, steps, annotations or answers",
      "issuer_allocation": "issuer = id ticker prefix; stable SHA256(issuer) mod 100 mapped to 60/20/20 train/valid/test, independent of labels; a row is kept only if its allocated fold equals its publisher split (publisher dev -> valid), blocking issuers and honouring the upstream repartition",
